---
title: Checkout flow
---
%% A web checkout with a payment decision, grouped by tier.
flowchart LR
  subgraph client [Customer side]
    shopper([Shopper]) -->|submits cart| web[Web app]
  end
  subgraph backend [Order platform]
    api[Orders API<br>validates the cart]
    pay{Payment ok?}
    subgraph data [Storage]
      db[(Orders DB)]
    end
  end
  web -->|POST /orders| api
  api -->|charge card| pay
  pay -->|yes| db
  pay -. no .-> fail>Payment failed]
  classDef svc fill:#dbeafe,stroke:#2563eb
  class api svc
  style web fill:#fff
